rView.swift`\n431\t   - Add \"錄音喚醒語\" row with a navigation link / `.sheet` to `RecordingView(alarm: alarm)`\n432\t   - Show mic icon + \"已錄音\" / \"尚未錄音\" status based on `alarm.recordingName.isEmpty`\n433\t   - Acceptance: tapping the row opens `RecordingView`; saving a recording updates `alarm.recordingName`; saving shows \"已錄音\" status\n434\t\n435\t4. Modify: `SunnyWalker/Views/Home/HomeView.swift`\n436\t   - Gate the \"+\" (add alarm) button and any settings entry behind `ParentalGateView`\n437\t   - Present `ParentalGateView` as a `.sheet`; on success proceed to `AlarmEditorView`\n438\t   - Acceptance: tapping \"+\" presents parental gate before opening AlarmEditorView\n439\t\n440\t5. Add: placeholder `.caf` files to `SunnyWalker/Theme/Sounds/`\n441\t   - Create minimal valid (silent or 1-second tone) `totoro_breath.caf` and `leaf_rustle.caf`\n442\t   - Register them in `project.pbxproj` Copy Bundle Resources phase\n443\t   - Acceptance: `Bundle.main.url(forResource: \"totoro_breath\", withExtension: \"caf\")` returns non-nil; AlarmRingView no longer logs \"no recording — skipping\"\n444\t\n445\t**Carry-overs from today**:\n446\t- `.caf` assets absent → item 5 above\n447\t- AlarmEditorView → RecordingView navigation gap → item 3 above\n448\t- `sampleAlarms` @Model without ModelContext (low priority; do not block Day 6)\n449\t- `AudioPlayer.isPlaying` not auto-reset (low priority; add delegate only if non-loop paths are used in Day 6)\n450\t\n451\t**Constraints**:\n452\t- `ParentalGateView` question must NOT be simple arithmetic — Apple Kids review requirement (§6.4)\n453\t- No third-party SDKs\n454\t- Explicitly list every new `.swift` file in your \"For next (B)\" section — validate.sh [0/4] will catch unregistered files\n455\t- Use theme tokens throughout — zero raw color/font literals\n456\t- Keep 22 tests passing; add at least 2 unit tests for `GateQuestion` logic\n457\t\n458\t**Files to read first**:\n459\t- Spec §4 stage 1 (ParentalGateView full code and 